Package: nido-desktop
Version: 0.2.1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nido-desktop-settings (>= 0.2.1), nido-hub (>= 0.2.1), nidoagent-cli (>= 0.2.1), nidoai-gateway (>= 0.2.1), nidooffice-cli (>= 0.2.1), nidooffice-desktop (>= 0.13.1-1), vielotus (>= 2.0.11), nido-ime-bridge (>= 0.2.2), nidobox (>= 1.5.1), wl-clipboard, xclip, geary, showtime | totem
Recommends: nautilus, gnome-terminal, zenity, libsecret-tools, fwupd, unattended-upgrades, flatpak, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, apparmor-utils, ufw
Maintainer: Nido Holdings <support@nido-holdings.com>
Homepage: https://nido-holdings.com
Description: Nido Minimal Desktop metapackage for Ubuntu LTS
 Installs the complete Nido Minimal Desktop experience on top of an official
 Ubuntu 26.04 / 24.04 GNOME Minimal desktop (GDM, Wayland, Nautilus, PipeWire):
 NidoAgent CLI, NidoAI Gateway, NidoHub Control Center, NidoOffice Suite
 (Desktop + CLI), NidoBox utilities, Geary lightweight email client, and
 Sen Viet (VieLotusIM) Vietnamese input over native IBus.
